[9.879165, "o", "Pipeline modules live with the CLI under /app/deskbin and as sibling sources under /app. Spool bytes sit in /app/dropwell. Fixture copies sit at /app/seed/dropwell. Side listing helper is /app/dropwalk.\r\n--- FORMAT ---\r\n"]
[9.879931, "o", "CLAT dump (little-endian):\r\n\r\n  magic     4 bytes  \"CLAT\"\r\n  version   u16\r\n  write_stamp u32   dump-write unix seconds\r\n  nstreams  u16\r\n  then n directory entries: stype u32, rva u32, size u32\r\n\r\nStream type 3 (exception): dwLowDateTime u32, dwHighDateTime u32, code u32.\r\nThose two dwords are a Windows FILETIME (100-nanosecond ticks; 10000000 ticks per second).\r\nThe FILETIME epoch is 1601-01-01, 11644473600 seconds before Unix epoch.\r\n\r\nStream type 15 (misc): 16-byte guid, then companion u8 (0 = primary, 1 = extra).\r\n\r\nDigest on the keg is SHA-256 (sha256) of the dump file, written as lowercase hex.\r\n\r\nExtra dumps added under the well, including names such as mid.clat, use this same layout.\r\nFixture copies of the well live at /app/seed/dropwell.\r\n"]
[9.880512, "o", "--- TREE ---\r\n"]
